{"id":2718,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为热烈庆祝中北大学建校85周年，以就业服务实效献礼校庆，我院联合计算机科学与技术学院、信息与通信工程学院、经济与管理学院，于5月18日上午在东区训练馆举办2026年四学院联合招聘会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HM4QgfL8C8ozMRLLNMRL4LinRGsnRCMiMzQkUzN8ozGDozv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRUSyZU1y8Mm-iol-PnRWfMRQfnRlZMmrkn7r7MmGDozrFnRWkMmLiLzQFM7UaU47JqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLR9igtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7085&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2CA8B46259B1D2A46AD5865BDED60695/D2B63516/4D0C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 807px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HMzVgRL4nfnmNaML4QVo77PUmr2nmGMYoz-ZnR78ozvZnR-0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkhfn1yYUYyZM8MfLzGbMRMRU4LsMmnVLzL8MNMfUN-Dn7nFozQ2M4nVMR6FM4AkL4v4gtXaQIveo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLR-0M4GZMSbw62o8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7085&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>活动现场秩序井然、氛围热烈。学院领导和班主任老师亲临现场，与企业代表交流对接，了解岗位需求与招聘进展，同时关心同学们的求职状态，为大家答疑解惑。我院学子积极参与其中，主动与企业HR面对面沟通，咨询岗位要求、发展前景等信息，展现出良好的求职风貌。本次招聘会汇聚多家优质企业，岗位覆盖面广，为同学们搭建了高效的求职对接平台。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HL7-gYnmC4MRlaoLzW2MNCPUllaoR-M4nlC4MmU8M4rko7-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7oSy8U1ysUln2nlMkUz6RL4vDoRWkL498nzC8MmCsMmVFL7liM7rVM7nFL8CZMlLJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLR9igtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7085&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0D94B7ADFECBA7C37682B384E6466761/0E54EE4D/3F85C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 794px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HozNgiMRLYLRNPLLRGiLlLsLz94MNlMsL7CZM4TkMm62M7U0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysn1y4L1h2oRNDMm6RMzA7LNLZnRCaM4UbLzvbUzL4o7VFUznRUlnRM8nFMlVkMN-YgtXaQIveo4OepIVY_2T4pShXptQ0g47aLR-0M4GZMSbw62o8c&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7085&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次联合招聘会既是校庆系列暖心活动，也是学院服务学生就业的重要举措，有效打通了校企对接渠道，助力学子高质量就业，也彰显了学校的育人初心与责任担当，为建校85周年献上了一份务实而温暖的礼物。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HM4QgfL8C8ozMRLLNMRL4LinRGsnRCMiMzQkUzN8ozGDozv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRUSyZU1y8Mm-iol-PnRWfMRQfnRlZMmrkn7r7MmGDozrFnRWkMmLiLzQFM7UaU47JqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysLR9igtA8pUocc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7085&e=.jpeg"}